<title>UK: T&amp;N buying Metal Leve for 31 mln stg.</title>
<headline>T&amp;N buying Metal Leve for 31 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK auto components maker T&amp;N Plc said on Thursday it was buying U.S. firm Metal Leve Inc for 31 million stg.  </p>
<p>It said that the consideration will be paid on completion in cash from existing resources and debt assumed.</p>
<p>&quot;Metal Leve Inc is an excellent acquisition for T&amp;N and its Piston Products Group and is a further step towards world leadership in pistons,&quot; said Colin Hope, Chairman of T&amp;N.</p>
<p>He said the purchase significantly enhances the company's position in the mid-range diesel piston and systems market.</p>
<p>London Newsroom + 44 171 542 4019</p>
